SmartCare v0.2 – Requirements Specification

1. Problem and Scope
SmartCare uses spreadsheets to manage their data which causes high risk to them of causing error, they need a proper system to manage their data properly, easily and fast and managing the data by spreadsheets also increases chances of duplication of the data.  The proposed SmartCare system will provide a simple system for clinic staff to manage patient records, practitioner information and appointments. The system also provides an easy way to manage and modify the data as well. 
2. Stakeholders
Stakeholder	Need	Evidence
Patients	Proper information of them for the appointment.	Patients Records are managed by the clinic 
Practitioners	Proper Access provided to them about their schedules 	The system needs to manage the 
Reception/Admin Staff	An efficient way to manage patients and appointments.	The current process uses spreadsheets and paper records.
Clinic Manager	Reliable and organised information and improved administrative efficiency.	The clinic wants software to improve its current processes.
